{
  "_note": "Idle FX spec for 19 of the 57 cucumbers, produced by the gauntlet (48 candidates -> 3-lens screen -> head-to-head -> assignment) and translated here from the winners' prose into typed properties. Total ParticleEmitter Rate across all 19 models is ~20.8/s.",
  "_treatments": [
    "Speckle Wave",
    "Governor Spin",
    "Three Leaves Down",
    "Settle Skirt",
    "The Vent Breathes",
    "Orbits Keep Time",
    "Shared Plot Wind",
    "Hanging Weight",
    "Loose Speckles (reserve)"
  ],
  "_dropped": [
    "A live per-frame wind vector shared across a plot: a constant Acceleration reads the same at these amplitudes and costs nothing.",
    "Boosting the moon-tree light by 1.4x outside ClockTime 6-18: that couples the models to a day/night system this place does not have.",
    "spin on NarmekGalaxyTree.Discs and NarmekMoonTree.Saucers: those MeshParts each hold several discs at different offsets, so a centroid spin swung the group around a meaningless midpoint and grew the footprint ~3 studs. Both now use twirl (about the mast), and the galaxy moonlet's orbit radius came in from 2.2 to 1.7."
  ],
